# Project Guidelines & Rules (GEMINI.md Example)

These rules are permanently enforced across all tasks in this repository.

---

## 1. Code Style & Architecture
- All API handlers must validate request schemas using Zod or Pydantic before processing.
- Maintain a strict separation between business logic and database queries.
- Never hardcode API keys, secrets, or environment credentials.

---

## 2. Testing & Verification
- Always run unit tests before marking a feature complete: `npm test` or `pytest`.
- Ensure new endpoints have at least 80% test coverage.

---

## 3. Communication & Output
- Format responses concisely using GitHub-flavored Markdown.
- Provide clickable file links using `file://` scheme when referencing files.
